  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: d0e06f179b05a9346a618d4dc0a79844, type: 3}
  m_Name: ThirdTutorial
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::FoolsBrand.UI.TutorialSequence
  <Tutorials>k__BackingField:
  - <AdvanceCondition>k__BackingField: 0
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Good job on that last slime. Dying to it would
      have been really embarrassing. I'm going to tell you a couple more tips that
      will help you live a little longer.
  - <AdvanceCondition>k__BackingField: 0
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Attacking different parts can affect how much
      damage you deal to the enemy. This is because parts can have different defenses
      or be a weak spot of an enemy.
  - <AdvanceCondition>k__BackingField: 0
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: If a part has defense it will reduce the amount
      of damage you deal. Whereas if it's a weak point it will cause you to deal
      more damage to the monster's main body.
  - <AdvanceCondition>k__BackingField: 0
    <TutorialText>k__BackingField: Try it for yourself on this slime, and if you
      don't die I'll see you in the next fight.
